{"task_id": "Mbpp/79", "solution": "class Word:\n    \"\"\"\n    Domain object representing a word.\n    Provides methods to get length and check if length is odd.\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, value: str) -> None:\n        self.value: str = value\n\n    def length(self) -> int:\n        return len(self.value)\n\n    def is_length_odd(self) -> bool:\n        return (self.length() % 2) == 1\n\ndef word_len(word: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the length of the given word (after trimming whitespace) is odd.\n    Assumes valid string input as per completion constraints.\n    \"\"\"\n    normalized_word = word.strip()\n    word_obj = Word(normalized_word)\n    return word_obj.is_length_odd()"}
